@SportConnect.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5001

### 1. Đăng ký tài khoản mới (Register)
POST {{SportConnect.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@gmail.com",
  "username": "testuser123",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "fullName": "Test User",
  "phone": "0123456789"
}

###

### 2. Đăng nhập (Login)
POST {{SportConnect.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "testuser123",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### 3. Đăng nhập bằng Email (Login with Email)
POST {{SportConnect.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "testuser@gmail.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}
